{"updated":"2026-09-12T21:50:55.807Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Trump's comments on a united Ireland may have targeted audience across the Atlantic. Elsewhere, anthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for AI development to slow down. And saudi Arabia closes East-West pipeline as Houthis tighten grip on Red Sea. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.9 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 2.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 54 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.1 near 101 km S of Yudomari, Japan. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.36,0.41,0.44,0.5,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.65,0.69,0.73,0.86,0.95,1.13,1.41,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.75,1.8,1.83,1.92,1.97,2.02,2.06,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.21,2.26,2.31,2.36,2.39,2.45,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.62,2.68,2.75,2.81,2.93,3.02,3.17,3.19,3.24,3.26,3.32,3.37,3.42,3.52,3.6,3.66,3.71,3.76,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.16,4.2,4.28,4.34,4.42,4.52,4.57,4.69,4.72,4.78,4.81,4.87,4.98,5.13,5.28,5.72,5.8,5.86,5.92,5.97,6.01,6.05,6.08,6.14,6.18,6.24,6.29,6.35,6.41,6.44,6.49,6.54,6.58,6.62,6.65,6.7,6.73,6.82,6.88,6.98,7.07,7.15,7.25,7.28,7.36,7.51,7.56,7.61,7.66,7.72,7.75,7.84,8.01,8.1,8.19,8.24,8.3,8.32,8.36,8.39,8.43,8.46,8.52,8.6,8.65,8.71,8.77,8.82,8.89,8.93,9,9.11,9.17,9.23,9.29,9.33,9.38,9.41,9.47,9.51,9.58,9.62,9.67,9.71,9.78,9.83,9.87,9.89,9.91,9.94,10,10.03,10.08,10.13,10.19,10.24,10.32,10.4,10.49,10.62,11.32,11.44,11.51,11.56,11.61,11.64,11.7,11.74,11.78,11.9,11.94,12.09,12.2,12.26,12.32,12.36,12.41,12.47,12.54,12.6,12.64,12.71,12.77,12.89,12.96,12.99,13.07,13.13,13.25,13.3,13.39,13.46,13.53